{"id": "ev-79e19d688da9", "time": "2026-11-27T18:27:58.756+00:00", "session_id": "s-20261127-212752-01e427", "run_id": "20261127-212752-bf4ecd", "type": "model_response", "data": {"usage": {"input_tokens": 1538, "output_tokens": 160, "cached_input_tokens": 1280}, "usage_raw_available": true, "tool_call_recovered_from_text": false, "content": "В функции calculate_total в файле order.py неверно учитывается скидка. Вместо вычитания discount_percent из суммы цен, нужно вычитать процент от суммы цен.\n\nИсправлю функцию calculate_total так, чтобы скидка учитывалась как процент от суммы цен. Затем запущу тесты.", "tool_calls": [{"id": "call_VE1v70fY6lTl5cmrljhhWpU7", "name": "write_file"}]}}
{"id": "ev-75aea6f49d7b", "time": "2026-11-27T18:27:58.757+00:00", "session_id": "s-20261127-212752-01e427", "run_id": "20261127-212752-bf4ecd", "type": "tool_call", "data": {"call_id": "call_VE1v70fY6lTl5cmrljhhWpU7", "name": "write_file", "arguments": {"path": "order.py", "content": "def calculate_total(prices: list[float], discount_percent: float) -> float:\n    if discount_percent < 0 or discount_percent > 100:\n        raise ValueError(\"Discount percent must be between 0 and 100\")\n    total = sum(prices)\n    discount_amount = total * discount_percent / 100\n    return total - discount_amount\n"}, "arguments_raw": null, "phase": "execution", "task_id": null, "kind": "builtin", "effect": "write", "server": null, "tool": null}}
